OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fbecome showery during the evening as
OL,7,Fthe winds turn into the southwest. The
OL,8,Fshowers will become well scattered
OL,9,Fovernight with occasional clear spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FIt will be bright with sunny
OL,12,Fspells and a scattering of showers,
OL,13,Fthe showers dying out during the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Moderate or fresh
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
