OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy early on Saturday, turning
OL,7,Fdrier and brighter in the afternoon.
OL,8,FBright with a scattering of showers on
OL,9,FSunday then cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,10,Frain on Monday.
